                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Alright just finished the story, here's all my thoughts spoiler free (all of this is my personal opinion).\nI'm going to give the game 8/10. It's just too short for me to give a higher rating. When I play story games I tend to go really slow and try to make sense of everything happening, so for this to only take 2 hours for me really shows how short the story is. BUT I would still highly recommend regardless.\nThere are some plot twists so expect those, not saying anything more about that.\nSo if you just want a quick story game to 100% definitely give this a try! It's free so there is nothing to lose.",
